window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Isabelle</b></p> <p>Jericho St. James hates my family.</p> <p>Powerful, wealthy beyond belief, he's the most dangerous man I know.</p> <p>And I belong to him.</p> <p>He’s taken me from my home. </p> <p>He'll make me his wife. </p> <p>And he’s made it very clear I’ll be sleeping in his bed. </p> <p>But my beast has a secret. </p> <p>His one weakness. One that makes hating him impossible. </p> <p>He has a daughter. </p> <p>And he’ll do anything to keep her safe. </p> <p><b>Jericho</b></p> <p>The Bishops stole what money cannot replace. </p> <p>A life for a life. Now I’ll take one of theirs. </p> <p>Isabelle is my pawn. </p> <p>I will make her my wife. </p> <p>I will bed her. </p> <p>She will be mine in every way. </p> <p>And once I take what I need from her, I will erase the Bishop family as if they never existed at all.</p>"; 
